    "proof": "CI (starfleet/scripts/check_axioms.sh): project builds against its pinned Mathlib and the terminal theorem's `#print axioms` is a subset of [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound].",
    "faithfulness": "Manual: the hosted statement is unfolded through any named Prop and compared definition by definition against the Formal Conjectures statement it is linked from. Statuses: match, match-with-note, unchecked, blocked."
  },
